    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot Land is real \u2014 and you're about to conquer it.</strong><br>Embark on an explosive and chaotic journey where your goal is simple: reach the legendary island known as Loot Land. Armed with your jetpack and a highly customizable cannon, you'll face intense battles against enemies who are also chasing fame, glory, and riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own weapon using parts and modifiers collected throughout the adventure. Mix attack styles, sub-weapons, and special effects to create unique and powerful builds in every run.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot Land is real \u2014 and you're about to conquer it.</strong><br>Embark on an explosive and chaotic journey where your goal is simple: reach the legendary island known as Loot Land. Armed with your jetpack and a highly customizable cannon, you'll face intense battles against enemies who are also chasing fame, glory, and riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own weapon using parts and modifiers collected throughout the adventure. Mix attack styles, sub-weapons, and special effects to create unique and powerful builds in every run.</p>",
